     rruuee — RealTek RTL8150 USB to Fast Ethernet controller driver

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     To compile this driver into the kernel, place the following lines in your
     kernel configuration file:

           ddeevviiccee uuhhccii
           ddeevviiccee oohhccii
